## Local-only LiveKit secrets (do not commit as livekit/.env is gitignored)
## Copy this file to livekit/.env and set real values.
##
## Format:
## LIVEKIT_KEYS=api_key_1: api_secret_1,api_key_2: api_secret_2
## Secret must be at least 32 characters.
LIVEKIT_KEYS=your_api_key: your_api_secret_with_at_least_32_chars
